  "text": "Looking for a showstopping home built for entertaining? Imagine waking up to sweeping views of downtown San Francisco, hosting friends on expansive outdoor decks, and enjoying unforgettable sunsets from your private rooftop retreat. Welcome to 755 Duncan Street, one of Noe Valley's most impressive view residences. Completely reimagined from the studs up, this custom residence spans three levels and more than 3,700 square feet of beautifully designed living space. With sophisticated finishes, abundant natural light, and exceptional indoor-outdoor flow, every detail has been thoughtfully considered. The main level features a stunning chef's kitchen, spacious family room, and dining area that seamlessly connect to the backyard. A serene primary suite and additional bedroom complete this level. Upstairs, three additional bedrooms include a second primary suite with its own private view deck. Expansive terraces and an oversized entertainer's deck offer incredible spaces for gatherings, relaxation, and taking in the San Francisco skyline. The true showstopper? An interior-accessible rooftop deck showcasing panoramic views across Noe Valley and downtown San Francisco. Whether enjoying morning coffee or entertaining beneath the city lights, the setting is simply unforgettable. The lower level features a light-filled two-bedroom, two-bathroom ADU with a private patio, ideal for guests, extended family, or potential rental income. A two-car garage with generous storage completes the home. 755 Duncan Street delivers a rare combination of luxury, breathtaking views, exceptional outdoor living, and versatility all in the heart of Noe Valley. This is San Francisco living at its finest.",
