  "text": "On a lovely, flat, tree-lined street in the warmest part of Noe Valley, 1 block to the Sanchez Slow Street and the J, and a short walk to 24th Street's village, this is the one you've been waiting for! Renovated in 2013 at ~3,015 square feet, the home offers 5BDRs (4 with ensuite BAs!), 5.5BAs, a family space with a wet bar, terraces on every level, and a dreamy, expansive south-facing backyard. The heart and soul of the home is the open kitchen, living and dining spaces that flow seamlessly onto the terrace overlooking the backyard. The pro kitchen is thoughtfully designed and beautifully executed with quartz countertops, Ann Sacks tile backsplash, Liebherr refrigerator, Bosch induction range, Wolf microwave, filtered hot/cold water, Bosch dishwasher, a large pantry, and a spacious center stone island. The kitchen flows to the dining area with French doors opening to a tiled terrace. The living room is lined with windows framing Noe's hillside and quintessential St Paul's cathedral spires, and is punctuated by beautiful wood built-in shelving and a gas fireplace. Two generous bedrooms each with custom built-in wardrobes and tiled ensuite baths complete the main level. Down a skylit stairway is a family space with a built-in wet bar and wine refrigerator, opening with glass doors to a second tiled terrace. There are 2 spacious ensuite BDRs and 2BAs on this level. The beautiful and serene primary suite opens to the deck. Walk-in closet with built-in wardrobe and shelving. En suite bath with custom double vanity, Hansgrohe fixtures, soaking tub, towel warmer and more. 2nd BDR here w custom built-in wardrobes and a beautiful tiled ensuite bath. Laundry room with custom built shelving. At the ground level is a 5th BDR that opens with glass French doors to the resort-style backyard - the perfect gym, private home office, au pair or guest quarters. The expansive, south-facing backyard with a lush, level lawn and stone patio is accessible from all levels of the home. Newer (2013) systems. A/C on main level w Nest thermostat (2020). Quarter-sawn white oak flooring. Whole-home air purification system. Ethernet wiring perfect for work from home. Built-in speakers. Custom blackout shades. New sewer line to the street (2026). Garage with interior access and SUV parking. 95 WalkScore and a 91 BikeScore a walkers and bikers paradise! Walk to Sanchez's Slow Street, Chloe's Cafe, Omnivore Books, the J, 24th St village. Mins to 101/280 + shuttles. The whole package!",
